## Full session path

Like Impeccable's plan → build → review → refine:

| Phase | Command | Role |
|-------|---------|------|
| Context | `/ux-skills init` | Project UX context file |
| Plan | `/ux-skills strategize` · `/ux-skills investigate` | Frame problem with evidence |
| Design | `/ux-skills journey` · `/ux-skills organize` | Flows, IA, words |
| AI product | `/ux-skills ai-governors` · `/ux-skills ai-inputs` | Control, trust, identity |
| Review | `/ux-skills evaluate` · `/ux-skills audit` | Quality + a11y |
| Craft | `/ux-skills craft` · `/ux-skills cognitive-load-conversion` | Surface quality |
| Harden | `/ux-skills fortify` · `/ux-skills transpose` | Real-world + platforms |
| Ship | `/ux-skills specify` | Engineering handoff |

Cross-cutting anytime: `/philosopher`, `/storytelling`, `/measure`.

---

## Decision tree

```
What do you need?
│
├─ First time on this repo          → /ux-skills init
├─ Don't know the problem           → /ux-skills strategize
├─ Need research plan / synthesis   → /ux-skills investigate
├─ Design a user flow               → /ux-skills journey
├─ Structure navigation / IA        → /ux-skills organize
├─ Write UI copy                    → /ux-skills articulate
├─ AI feature (control/trust/input) → /ux-skills ai-governors
├─ Evaluate UX heuristic          → /ux-skills evaluate
├─ Technical quality check          → /ux-skills audit
├─ Accessibility                    → /ux-skills include
├─ Visual craft / AI-slop UI        → /ux-skills craft
├─ Forms feel heavy                 → /ux-skills cognitive-load-conversion
├─ Edge cases / empty / error       → /ux-skills fortify
├─ Ready for eng                    → /ux-skills specify
└─ Stuck                            → /ux-skills philosopher
```

